    "name": "#7-J5Z: The Driftwood Experiment",
    "steam_appid": 3342050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in\u00a0a universe where gemstones are abundant... but fauna and flora are scarce.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342050/extras/763d7068fb082b9b8065977bbe5a8612.avif?t=1748040638\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot is sent to a newly found underwater cave to discover the fish and plants that inhabit the area. Sunken driftwood logs containing a fungus, rest on the beds of the cave. This special fungus with unique properties will be key to complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLO DEVELOPED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE-TO-PLAY</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect fish and plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful environment to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and easy to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax... enjoy the underwater vibe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>NOTES:</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is short and does not have a save progression feature. Depending on playstyle, it may take up to one hour to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full screen water motion effect can be toggled on/off in game for those who are sensitive to such effects.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in\u00a0a universe where gemstones are abundant... but fauna and flora are scarce.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342050/extras/763d7068fb082b9b8065977bbe5a8612.avif?t=1748040638\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot is sent to a newly found underwater cave to discover the fish and plants that inhabit the area. Sunken driftwood logs containing a fungus, rest on the beds of the cave. This special fungus with unique properties will be key to complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLO DEVELOPED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE-TO-PLAY</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect fish and plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful environment to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and easy to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax... enjoy the underwater vibe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>NOTES:</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is short and does not have a save progression feature. Depending on playstyle, it may take up to one hour to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full screen water motion effect can be toggled on/off in game for those who are sensitive to such effects.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A simple and short cozy game where you play as an unusual robot, exploring an underwater cave system.",
